<title>USA: Iowa-S Minn fed cattle market quiet, no sales - USDA.</title>
<headline>Iowa-S Minn fed cattle market quiet, no sales - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES 1996-12-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Steers and heifers were not tested on a live or carcass basis, compared to Friday's close, USDA said.</p>
<p>Heifers: Select and Choice 2-4 1175 lbs ld 112.00.</p>
<p>Reported sales for Mon: 100    Week to Date: 900</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312-408-8720))</p>
